  "metadata": {
    "description": "Stack-first skills library covering QA, frontend, backend, data, and business-analysis: install one self-contained plugin per tech stack. `qa-{java,dotnet,typescript}` bundle every QA discipline — API/UI/mobile/performance/LLM/BDD authoring and verification, manual-QA process, CI/CD, reporting, and OWASP-mapped security. `fe-{blazor,react}` are phased frontend dev-stack agents (scaffold → architecture → features → quality → tests → review). `be-{dotnet,java,node}` are phased backend dev-stack agents for design-pattern application, ORM persistence, and Auth0/Cognito service-side auth. `devops` ships the platform lane — container images, IaC, cloud deploys, and build/deploy pipelines. `data` and `business-analysis` round out the database-engineering and cross-feature requirements domains.",
    "version": "2.14.0"
  },
