    {
      "name": "fe-blazor",
      "description": "Self-contained senior frontend Blazor developer plugin for .NET 8/9/10 (Blazor Web App, unified render modes). Covers the full FE build lifecycle end-to-end: project scaffold and render-mode strategy, architecture foundations (state, component library, styling, responsive design), feature build (pages/components/forms, API + live/realtime data, motion, UX writing, data-testids), quality layers (accessibility, performance, error resilience, SEO), and bUnit v2 component tests — plus a distinctive-visual-design critique loop. Bundles the Auth0 Blazor auth skills and the stack-agnostic design-craft skills (frontend-design, design-tokens, dataviz, brand-intake, iconography, ux-heuristics, theme-factory, ux-writing, web-design-guidelines) and the phased fe-blazor orchestrator agent — install just this one plugin for a complete Blazor frontend toolkit.",
